  "note": "Free-tier LLM providers tried in order after Gemini. Keyed providers are used only when their key is configured; ones without a key (or with keyOptional) also work anonymously. Models are discovered live unless a fixed free list is given. Source list: https://github.com/mnfst/awesome-free-llm-apis. Limits change often; see README. Agent routing (2.2.8): providers marked strong (best free coding models) first, then full-size Gemini Flash, then Flash-Lite, then the rest; each provider only gets prompts that fit its context window (tokens) and answers up to maxOutput.",
